                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Bought this game soon after it came out years ago, can't believe I'm just getting around to it now. Easily Housemarque's best work, at least that I've played. Amazing art direction, graphics, music, and the combat is sublime. Constantly kicks my butt but it's so much fun seeing myself get just a bit better with each run. \r\n\r\n10/10 definite recommend if you're into the genre!",
